:: Bus Chikan Passenger Watch
<<effects>>
당신은 <<person4>><<person>>【이가】 계속해서 <<person3>><<person>>【을를】 성추행하는 모습을 지켜본다.
<br>
<<person4>><<person>>【이가】 <<person3>><<persons>> 속옷 안으로 손을 더 깊숙이 밀어 넣고 <<him>>【을를】 쓰다듬기 시작하지만, 버스 안의 다른 승객들은 아무도 눈치채지 못하는 듯하다.
<br>
When the <<person4>><<person>> catches you looking, <<he>> calmly pulls <<his>> hand back and checks <<his>> watch as though nothing happened. Then <<he>> gives you a sly wink and turns away, while the <<person3>><<person>> seizes the moment to slip out of the bus with tears streaming down <<his>> face.
<br><br>
<<promiscuity1>>

<<link [[다음|Bus Chikan End]]>><</link>>

:: Bus Chikan Passenger Look Away
<<effects>>
You can't bring yourself to keep watching, so you fix your eyes anywhere else: the grimy window, the flickering route display, the floor near your shoes.
<br><br>
Even so, you can still hear the <<person3>><<person>> making soft moans nearby, and that does little to settle your nerves.
<br><br>
<<link [[다음|Bus Chikan End]]>><</link>>

