	<<set $bus to "wolf">>
<<case 9>>
	<<set $bus to "harvest">>
<<case 10>>
	<<set $bus to "oxford">>
<<case 11>>
	<<set $bus to "danube">>
<<case 12>>
	<<set $bus to "mer">>
<<case 13>>
	<<set $bus to "cliff">>
<</switch>>
<<destination>>

:: Bus Chikan End
<<effects>>
<<tiredness 3>>
After what feels like an eternity, your stop finally comes into sight.
<br><br>
You hold yourself together for a few more seconds, waiting for the doors to open.
<br><br>
